This folder holds GeminiApiConfig.asset, which is gitignored because it
carries the Gemini API key. Create your own:

    Assets/Config -> right click -> Create -> StudyWithMe -> Gemini API Config

Name it exactly GeminiApiConfig, then fill in apiKey from
https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and drag the asset onto the
GeminiLiveVoiceSession component's Config field in Room.unity.

This file exists only so git keeps the folder; Unity ignores dotfiles,
so it generates no .meta and never enters the asset database.
